<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PARIS OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PARIS OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results at the $2.55</p>
<p>million Paris Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 6-2</p>
<p>3-6 6-2</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Arnaud Boetsch (France) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
<p>7-6 (9-7) 6-1</p>
<p>12-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Stefan Edberg (Sweden) 6-4 7-6 (8-6)</p>
</text>
